            "heading": "Tennis Elbow",
            "image_heading": "shopify://shop_images/tennis_elbow_icon_7d7277a7-f138-4873-89d1-7972d76f2f07.svg",
            "image_style_heading": "rounded",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-square",
            "description": "<p>Elbow flare-ups are often tied to overloaded forearms and gripping, not just the spot that hurts. CastleFlexx ( insert elbow into hammock) helps you lengthen the forearm-wrist chain and open the shoulders with less strain on your grip, so your body feels looser overall.</p>",
